o figure out whether I can squeeze in a visit to my aunt, so what's planned for the 17th?\", \"Hmm, that's too packed — let's move the first one to tuesday and just cancel the second one altogether.\", \"Oh, and before I forget, the mortgage stuff needs sorting, so could you book in a call with the bank tomorrow at half seven in the evening?\", \"Something else — I was showing someone my pictures and lost track, what's the last photo I took?\", \"One more thing, since people keep asking me where it is — could you email Mirela the address of the party?\"], [\"Could you tell me what's planned for the 17th, please?\", \"Would you mind moving the first one to tuesday and cancelling the second one?\", \"Could you please book in a call with the bank tomorrow at half seven in the evening?\", \"Could you show me the last photo I took, please?\", \"Would you please email Mirela the address of the party?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0034\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you bin the, uh, the ask nicanor note?\", \"oh wait, scratch that, put it back\", \"ok so different thing, can you pull up the… the booking voucher thing?\", \"hang on, quick one — anything about dustpan in my expenses?\", \"ok back to the voucher, um, can you add a to-do to read the voucher document tuesday?\"], [\"Could you please bin the ask nicanor note?\", \"Actually, I've changed my mind — would you put it back, please?\", \"Could you pull up the booking voucher document for me, please?\", \"Sorry, before I forget — could you tell me whether any expenses mention dustpan, and which ones?\", \"Going back to that voucher, would you mind adding a task to read the voucher document tuesday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0035\", \"v\": [[\"Temmere house share — how much spent?\"], [\"For the Temmere house share, could you tell me how much I've spent so far?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0036\", \"v\": [[\"Temmere house share expenses?\"], [\"what've i spent on in Temmere house share\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0037\", \"v\": [[\"umm what time is the, uh,